# WR.0 — Word reports (not Excel)

When the user **asks for a report** (`რეპორტი`, report, Word report, `/report`, save this write-up):

1. **MUST** produce a **Word `.docx`** with the same structure as  
   `Cursor-Project/reports/Chat reports/2026/September/18/PDT-3483_Final_Liability_Amount_Dev_Report.docx`
2. **MUST NOT** use Excel as the report (unless they explicitly ask for a spreadsheet).
3. **MUST** still write a **Cursor canvas**. Word does not replace canvas.
4. **MUST** follow **`.cursor/skills/word-report/SKILL.md`** (title, meta, intro, glance table, per-case stories with **live** amounts and portal links).
5. Save under **`Cursor-Project/reports/Chat reports/YYYY/<english-month>/DD/`** (Rule 0.6). English on disk (Rule 0.7).

`/feedback` and Playwright Slack path 2 stay as those workflows define. Violation is a **MUST**.
